		(descr "1210 (3225 metric) 0 ohm resistor pads, geometry from the Sofar mote's R11 (Vault:FP-CRCW1210-e3-IPC_B), joined by a 1.0 mm copper bridge (net tie): connected as fabricated. Cut the bridge to open; refit a 0 ohm 1210 (Vishay CRCW12100000Z0EA, as R11) to close again. To cut: score both ends of the bridge, lift the copper out, check open with a meter. No paste: nothing is placed by assembly.")
